			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 191851001,
					"content": "…逐影庭在皮埃爾的住所裡，好像沒有見到過這些木桶。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						191851002
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 191851002,
					"content": "直接抱著這些桶過來也太顯眼了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						191851003
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 191851003,
					"content": "嗯，不像是皮埃爾的行動模式…那會是怎麼運來的呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						191851004
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				},
				{
					"id": 191851004,
					"content": "（仔細觀察木桶…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						191851005
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 191851005,
					"content": "（木桶外壁有浸泡過的痕跡，桶身周圍都留下了乾涸後的水漬…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						191851006
					],
					"speakerTitle": "調查"
				},
				{
					"id": 191851006,
					"content": "（這些水漬顯得異常「規矩」，木桶的上半部分幾乎沒有任何水漬。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						191851007
					],
					"speakerTitle": "調查"
				},
				{
					"id": 191851007,
					"content": "（桶蓋似乎不是很嚴實，邊緣處留有不小的縫隙，但內部並沒有進水的痕跡。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						191851008
					],
					"speakerTitle": "調查"
				},
				{
					"id": 191851008,
					"content": "只有下半部分泡過水嗎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "琳妮特"
				}
			]
		},
